{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1431076-how-to-defeat-a-digital-chimera-as-kinain","id":1431076,"title":"How to defeat a digital chimera, as kinain?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-01-04T14:34:21-08:00","id":1431076,"title":"How to defeat a digital chimera, as kinain?","content":"Im trying to come up with a plot for a small one-shot for a kinain game. But I couldn't think anything interesting past the premise.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>The premise</b><br /> There is a digital chimera going around. What it means? Well it's a digital chimera, it's made of data, but chimerical data. Any computer can run the data, but only those who can see chimerical reality can see how this chimera affects computers. The chimera don't steal info or hack into computers, it can't do that. Instead it fills the whole screen with random letters and symbols until it's impossible to see or use the device. It only target changelings, kinains and ehcnated humans. It asks for dross offerings in front of the device to go away.<br /> <br /> The chimera has very simple powers, but it can be in multiple places at once, and even thought it cannot hack into anything, it could potentially make computers and devices of any kind impossible to use for changelings, something pretty dangerous. Many changelings use computers in their faily life on some level. Then, thinking that maybe kinains are unnaffected the changelings ask some of them to &quot;fix the computer&quot; but turns out they are affected too. This, the players, a group of kinain, need to find a way to stop this simple but dangerous chimera. <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>What Im looking for</b><br /> I want to think of a interesting way this chimera could be defeated, in a one-shot session, by a group of kinain. So it can't be too powerful, and the method can't be too complex or long to do. Any ideas? <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26021-rucun","name":"Rucun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-05T05:22:41-08:00","id":1431151,"title":"","content":"Hmmm digivices... and lots of them!<br /> <br /> Maybe find or commission the creation of. Vaccine Chimera to eat the Virus?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-05T07:56:29-08:00","id":1431167,"title":"","content":"Maybe you can ask a virtual adept? Or I think the fifth level of prop let\u2019s you work with things as complicated as a computer and by that the \u201cinternet\u201d theirs a digital dreaming thing that you could go to to do battle with the virus I think it\u2019s part of the \u201cnormal\u201d dreaming a knocker invention that lets people travel into cyberspace that sounds good","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-05T12:16:59-08:00","id":1431199,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1431076-how-to-defeat-a-digital-chimera-as-kinain?p=1431151#post1431151\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmmm digivices... and lots of them!<br /> <br /> Maybe find or commission the creation of. Vaccine Chimera to eat the Virus?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I Think the Dougal have some digital treasures or something. But If I go this route I probably need to think of a alternate challenge for them to earn this favor. Maybe gathering enough dross for the Dougal or Nocker to be able to work on this vaccine. <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26021-rucun","name":"Rucun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-05T12:21:02-08:00","id":1431200,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1431076-how-to-defeat-a-digital-chimera-as-kinain?p=1431167#post1431167\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe you can ask a virtual adept? Or I think the fifth level of prop let\u2019s you work with things as complicated as a computer and by that the \u201cinternet\u201d theirs a digital dreaming thing that you could go to to do battle with the virus I think it\u2019s part of the \u201cnormal\u201d dreaming a knocker invention that lets people travel into cyberspace that sounds good</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I had almost forgotten that. It's a interesting take,. Let's see if any of them will have enough prop to do that. But surely it's a good &quot;since you're good enought at this, you can bypass the problem&quot; which I really like to do to make the players feel like their spending was worth it. <br /> <br /> <br /> And yeah, the idea of going to the internet dreaming is very good too. I was not aware of that. Thanks a lot for the suggestion!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26021-rucun","name":"Rucun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-05T19:57:55-08:00","id":1431244,"title":"","content":"Negotiate with it? Find out what it can do and offer it dross and glamour for it to do it for you... maybe it can't change autumn programs.... but can it read them? Can it read bank numbers?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-07T20:34:13-08:00","id":1431441,"title":"","content":"If it is an actively agressive chimera, lure it out of the computer and then fight/trap it.<br /> If not, maybe befriend it so you'll make a powerful ally.<br /> <br /> Then, there's always the option of allowing autumn people access to the computer...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10198-luisarmander","name":"Luisarmander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-07T21:16:06-08:00","id":1431444,"title":"","content":"Can Banality be used against it?<br /> <br /> Can someone create a kind of chimerical anti-virus for it? I'm sure kithain, especially knockers, could. But I am not familiar enough with kinain to know if they could so such a thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-08T13:15:42-08:00","id":1431491,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Black Fox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1431076-how-to-defeat-a-digital-chimera-as-kinain?p=1431444#post1431444\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can Banality be used against it?<br /> <br /> Can someone create a kind of chimerical anti-virus for it? I'm sure kithain, especially knockers, could. But I am not familiar enough with kinain to know if they could so such a thing.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I guess? I mean, being a chimera, is not like the autumm people can see it, so it's banality would not ensue easily. But if someone kept mentioning this urban legend about the crazy virus, that no one can actually see, the many people doubting it could cause banality? <br /> <br /> <br /> Kinains can use arts just like changeling, they are usually just less skilled/know less arts, but there is not level cap to it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26021-rucun","name":"Rucun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-08T13:32:26-08:00","id":1431494,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1431076-how-to-defeat-a-digital-chimera-as-kinain?p=1431244#post1431244\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Negotiate with it? Find out what it can do and offer it dross and glamour for it to do it for you... maybe it can't change autumn programs.... but can it read them? Can it read bank numbers?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I imagine it like a actual desktop pet, you know, like those program who added some animation to your desktop, as if it was something that lived in it. I imagined it like this, it's spreads throught the internet, but live only on the &quot;screen&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26021-rucun","name":"Rucun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}